  "prefLabel": "Liq 907.07 Discount Adjustments for Off-Premises Licensees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 907.07 Discount Adjustments for Off-Premises Licensees.\n\n(a) The commission shall adjust discounts for off-premises licensees in order to optimize the profitability of the commission and maintain proper controls, provided that the commission shall not reduce discounts below the minimum percentages stated in this rule.\n\nSource. #13225, eff 6-30-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
